        "original_id": "2fbd08e6-fa9a-59a1-b01b-6c0822e0121b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tiburzio Spannocchi, Philip III of Spain, Philip II of Spain\n- Roles: king's engineer, King of Spain, King of Portugal, King of Naples, King of Sicily, King of Sardinia, Duke of Milan\n\nFacts:\n- Tiburzio Spannocchi (1541–1609) was also known as Spanucchi, Spanochi, Spanoqui, and Hispanochi.\n- Philip III of Spain was born on 14 April 1578 and died on 31 March 1621.\n- Tiburzio Spannocchi served as king's engineer to Philip II of Spain and later to Philip III of Spain.\n- Philip III was King of Spain.\n- Philip III, as Philip II, was also King of Portugal, Naples, Sicily, and Sardinia, and Duke of Milan.",
